abstract: >-
  Code, pre-registrations, external campaign telemetry and result records for a
  study of how a learner should use a fallible structural description of the
  system it is modelling, with pre-registered campaigns on a Kubernetes
  deployment and a free5GC 5G control plane.
keywords:
  - causal discovery
  - structural priors
  - distribution shift
  - root-cause analysis
  - pre-registration
